}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A contraction path belongs to the network it was derived from. That network \
has five tensors where the phase-space one has two, so reusing the earlier ",
 Cell[BoxData["path"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "37148c8b-98eb-4308-9485-1f42e7d84086"],
 " reports the arity mismatch before it ever reaches the complex tensors:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e06100a7-0dc3-42fa-9374-7aa6c0febff4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"TensorNetworkContraction", "[", 
  RowBox[{"tnComputational", ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Method", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<NetGraph\>\""}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[23]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"925d2eb3-1de1-4519-a0e9-4495a1c3d862"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"TensorNetworkContraction", "[", 
  RowBox[{"tnComputational", ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", "2"}], "}"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"Method", "\[Rule]", "\<\"NetGraph\"\>"}]}], "]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->
  "Out[23]= ",ExpressionUUID->"029ca6ab-1b7d-47d7-a767-361a20dde165"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["NetTrain"]], "paclet:ref/NetTrain"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "27a11332-3a24-4f9b-8bc6-0ca28cca8f8c"],
 " reports a final loss rather than an exact zero, so these are converged \
numbers rather than a closed form. The individual entries of the trained \
kernel are not stable between runs - they drift along a scaling that leaves \
their ratio fixed - while the angle read from that ratio is, which is why the \
angle is what the example reports."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8f9db04a-bac0-4706-a600-162fc71ba45f"],

Cell["\<\
Training a gate against a single input state does not determine it. The gate \
above is trained against its whole kernel, which pins every column; fitting \
only the circuit's output vector would leave the gate's action on the rest of \
the space free, and the recovered angle would mean nothing.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"41732922-c1e8-4e34-be11-e3ecbbe67237"],

